  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Tuberculosis Program - Viet Nam (01-Jan-2024-31-Dec-2026)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Viet Nam, Tuberculosis, Viet Nam National Lung Hospital (NTP)This program has the following goals: Find and treat all TB cases to decrease transmission.  Find and treat those who are infected with TB to prevent progression to active disease. The objectives of this program are: A 50 percent reduction of the incidence of TB by 2026 compared to 2018.  A 75 percent reduction in TB mortality in 2026 compared to 2018 (&lt;4 people per 100,000).  Maintain the proportion of MDR-TB among newly diagnosed TB patients below 5 percent</narrative>
  </description>
